<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-17T14:45:01.516Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 14:45:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;President Trump arrived in Manila ahead of the ASEAN summit, meeting leaders including Xi and Putin, while hundreds were arrested in anti-Trump protests linked to anger over the Iran war and an AI pact. Australia and the Philippines signed a new defence pact, and Canada concluded a free-trade deal with the Philippines, deepening military and economic ties. ASEAN leaders gathered but a South China Sea code of conduct pact remains unlikely. The UCDP recorded 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/11/17/us-president-trump-arrives-in-manila-ahead-of-asean-summit?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/15/australia-and-philippines-sign-new-defence-pact-amid-south-china-sea-tensions&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/14/canada-and-the-philippines-conclude-talks-on-free-trade-deal-mark-carney-says&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/live/2026/11/17/world/trump-asean-summit&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/17/world/asia/president-trump-visits-asia.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/apec-summit-what-trump-xi-and-putin-want/a-79970462?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.washingtonpost.com/world/2026/11/17/trump-arrives-manila-southeast-asia-navigates-us-china-rivalry/&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/6a0efb61-a756-4794-90db-3d591f42f17f?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/17/hundreds-arrested-manila-anti-trump-protests-philippines&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/17/world/asia/trump-manila-asean-late.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261117-trump-arrives-in-philippines-to-kick-off-asia-trip&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/16/world/asia/trump-asia-china-xi-putin.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
</item>
